{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "kpi-card",
  "title": "KPI card",
  "group": "Data display",
  "order": 3.5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "One metric on a dashboard: what it is, its value, how it changed against a stated baseline, and optionally its recent shape as a sparkline or mini bars. The value is the point; the change always says what it is compared with.",
    "id": "Satu metrik di dasbor: apa yang diukur, nilainya, bagaimana perubahannya terhadap pembanding yang disebutkan, dan bila perlu bentuk terbarunya sebagai sparkline atau mini bar. Nilainya yang utama; perubahan selalu menyebut pembandingnya."
  },
  "titleId": "KPI card",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "A dashboard's first row",
        "desc": "Sparkline, mini bars, and two cards with an icon. The color of each change follows its meaning: fewer returned applications is good, a slower reply is bad. The bottoms grow in on first view.",
        "html": "<div class=\"auto-grid\" style=\"--min: 220px;\" data-lds-grow>\n  <article class=\"kpi\" aria-labelledby=\"kpi-rev\">\n    <div class=\"kpi__head\"><span class=\"kpi__label\" id=\"kpi-rev\">Levy revenue</span><div style=\"position: relative; margin-left: auto;\">\n      <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"More actions for Levy revenue\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-lds-menu=\"kpi-rev-menu\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_horiz</span></button>\n      <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"kpi-rev-menu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Levy revenue\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0;\">\n        <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">bar_chart</span>Open report</button>\n        <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Download CSV</button>\n      </div>\n    </div></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__value\">Rp 482 M</div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>12.4%<span class=\"sr-only\"> up</span></span><span>from Rp 429 M in October</span></div>\n    <svg class=\"kpi__spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 52\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Daily revenue over 30 days, rising\"><path class=\"series-area\" d=\"M0.0 45.5 L8.3 30.0 L16.6 28.6 L24.8 32.9 L33.1 43.7 L41.4 46.0 L49.7 45.5 L57.9 39.0 L66.2 26.8 L74.5 23.5 L82.8 25.4 L91.0 30.5 L99.3 38.0 L107.6 39.4 L115.9 31.9 L124.1 22.5 L132.4 16.4 L140.7 28.6 L149.0 27.7 L157.2 33.3 L165.5 33.3 L173.8 25.8 L182.1 18.8 L190.3 16.9 L198.6 15.0 L206.9 26.3 L215.2 33.8 L223.4 22.1 L231.7 12.2 L240.0 8.0 L240 52 L0 52 Z\"></path><path class=\"series-line\" d=\"M0.0 45.5 L8.3 30.0 L16.6 28.6 L24.8 32.9 L33.1 43.7 L41.4 46.0 L49.7 45.5 L57.9 39.0 L66.2 26.8 L74.5 23.5 L82.8 25.4 L91.0 30.5 L99.3 38.0 L107.6 39.4 L115.9 31.9 L124.1 22.5 L132.4 16.4 L140.7 28.6 L149.0 27.7 L157.2 33.3 L165.5 33.3 L173.8 25.8 L182.1 18.8 L190.3 16.9 L198.6 15.0 L206.9 26.3 L215.2 33.8 L223.4 22.1 L231.7 12.2 L240.0 8.0\"></path></svg>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"kpi\" aria-labelledby=\"kpi-sign\">\n    <div class=\"kpi__head\"><span class=\"kpi__label\" id=\"kpi-sign\">New applications</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__value\">632</div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>8%<span class=\"sr-only\"> up</span></span><span>this week</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__bars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Applications per day over 14 days; today is the highest\"><i style=\"--h: 59%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 78%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 79%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 71%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 60%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 54%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 60%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 71%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 89%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 100%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 90%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 68%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 59%;\"></i><i class=\"is-on\" style=\"--h: 63%;\"></i></div>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"kpi\" aria-labelledby=\"kpi-ref\">\n    <div class=\"kpi__head\"><span class=\"kpi__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">receipt_long</span></span><span class=\"kpi__label\" id=\"kpi-ref\">Returned applications</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__value\">14</div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--down delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>36%<span class=\"sr-only\"> down</span></span><span>fewer than last month</span></div>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"kpi\" aria-labelledby=\"kpi-time\">\n    <div class=\"kpi__head\"><span class=\"kpi__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">schedule</span></span><span class=\"kpi__label\" id=\"kpi-time\">Average complaint reply time</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__value\">3.2<small>hours</small></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--bad\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>0.6 h<span class=\"sr-only\"> up</span></span><span>slower than last week</span></div>\n  </article>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Joined strip",
        "desc": "Four metrics of one page in one block. Resize the window: four columns, then two, then one.",
        "html": "<div class=\"kpi-grid-wrap\"><div class=\"kpi-grid\" style=\"--n: 4;\">\n  <div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"kpi__label\">Visitors</div><div class=\"kpi__value\">18,240</div><div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>6.1%<span class=\"sr-only\"> up</span></span><span>from 17,190</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"kpi__label\">Pages per visit</div><div class=\"kpi__value\">3.4</div><div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>0.2<span class=\"sr-only\"> up</span></span><span>from 3.2</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"kpi__label\">Bounce rate</div><div class=\"kpi__value\">41%</div><div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--down delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>3 pts<span class=\"sr-only\"> down</span></span><span>from 44%</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"kpi__label\">Time on page</div><div class=\"kpi__value\">2m 48s</div><div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--down delta--bad\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>9s<span class=\"sr-only\"> down</span></span><span>from 2m 57s</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "The whole card opens the report",
        "desc": "When a card leads to one place, make the card the link. It sinks slightly on press.",
        "html": "<a class=\"kpi kpi--link\" href=\"#kpi-link\" id=\"kpi-link\" style=\"width: 260px;\">\n  <div class=\"kpi__head\"><span class=\"kpi__label\">Open complaints</span><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">chevron_right</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kpi__value\">27</div>\n  <div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--down delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>5<span class=\"sr-only\"> down</span></span><span>since Monday</span></div>\n</a>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Baris pertama dasbor",
        "desc": "Sparkline, mini bar, dan dua kartu dengan ikon. Warna setiap perubahan mengikuti artinya: berkas dikembalikan yang berkurang itu baik, balasan yang melambat itu buruk. Bagian bawahnya tumbuh saat pertama terlihat.",
        "html": "<div class=\"auto-grid\" style=\"--min: 220px;\" data-lds-grow>\n  <article class=\"kpi\" aria-labelledby=\"kpi-rev\">\n    <div class=\"kpi__head\"><span class=\"kpi__label\" id=\"kpi-rev\">Penerimaan retribusi</span><div style=\"position: relative; margin-left: auto;\">\n      <button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Aksi lain untuk Penerimaan retribusi\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-lds-menu=\"kpi-rev-menu\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">more_horiz</span></button>\n      <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"kpi-rev-menu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Penerimaan retribusi\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0;\">\n        <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">bar_chart</span>Buka laporan</button>\n        <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">download</span>Unduh CSV</button>\n      </div>\n    </div></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__value\">Rp 482 jt</div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>12,4%<span class=\"sr-only\"> naik</span></span><span>dari Rp 429 jt pada Oktober</span></div>\n    <svg class=\"kpi__spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 52\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Penerimaan harian selama 30 hari, naik\"><path class=\"series-area\" d=\"M0.0 45.5 L8.3 30.0 L16.6 28.6 L24.8 32.9 L33.1 43.7 L41.4 46.0 L49.7 45.5 L57.9 39.0 L66.2 26.8 L74.5 23.5 L82.8 25.4 L91.0 30.5 L99.3 38.0 L107.6 39.4 L115.9 31.9 L124.1 22.5 L132.4 16.4 L140.7 28.6 L149.0 27.7 L157.2 33.3 L165.5 33.3 L173.8 25.8 L182.1 18.8 L190.3 16.9 L198.6 15.0 L206.9 26.3 L215.2 33.8 L223.4 22.1 L231.7 12.2 L240.0 8.0 L240 52 L0 52 Z\"></path><path class=\"series-line\" d=\"M0.0 45.5 L8.3 30.0 L16.6 28.6 L24.8 32.9 L33.1 43.7 L41.4 46.0 L49.7 45.5 L57.9 39.0 L66.2 26.8 L74.5 23.5 L82.8 25.4 L91.0 30.5 L99.3 38.0 L107.6 39.4 L115.9 31.9 L124.1 22.5 L132.4 16.4 L140.7 28.6 L149.0 27.7 L157.2 33.3 L165.5 33.3 L173.8 25.8 L182.1 18.8 L190.3 16.9 L198.6 15.0 L206.9 26.3 L215.2 33.8 L223.4 22.1 L231.7 12.2 L240.0 8.0\"></path></svg>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"kpi\" aria-labelledby=\"kpi-sign\">\n    <div class=\"kpi__head\"><span class=\"kpi__label\" id=\"kpi-sign\">Permohonan baru</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__value\">632</div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>8%<span class=\"sr-only\"> naik</span></span><span>minggu ini</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__bars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Permohonan per hari selama 14 hari; hari ini yang tertinggi\"><i style=\"--h: 59%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 78%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 79%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 71%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 60%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 54%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 60%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 71%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 89%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 100%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 90%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 68%;\"></i><i style=\"--h: 59%;\"></i><i class=\"is-on\" style=\"--h: 63%;\"></i></div>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"kpi\" aria-labelledby=\"kpi-ref\">\n    <div class=\"kpi__head\"><span class=\"kpi__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">receipt_long</span></span><span class=\"kpi__label\" id=\"kpi-ref\">Berkas dikembalikan</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__value\">14</div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--down delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>36%<span class=\"sr-only\"> turun</span></span><span>lebih sedikit dari bulan lalu</span></div>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"kpi\" aria-labelledby=\"kpi-time\">\n    <div class=\"kpi__head\"><span class=\"kpi__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic\">schedule</span></span><span class=\"kpi__label\" id=\"kpi-time\">Rata-rata waktu balas pengaduan</span></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__value\">3,2<small>jam</small></div>\n    <div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--bad\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>0,6 jam<span class=\"sr-only\"> naik</span></span><span>lebih lambat dari minggu lalu</span></div>\n  </article>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Strip gabungan",
        "desc": "Empat metrik dari satu halaman dalam satu blok. Ubah ukuran jendela: empat kolom, lalu dua, lalu satu.",
        "html": "<div class=\"kpi-grid-wrap\"><div class=\"kpi-grid\" style=\"--n: 4;\">\n  <div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"kpi__label\">Pengunjung</div><div class=\"kpi__value\">18.240</div><div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>6,1%<span class=\"sr-only\"> naik</span></span><span>dari 17.190</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"kpi__label\">Halaman per kunjungan</div><div class=\"kpi__value\">3,4</div><div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>0,2<span class=\"sr-only\"> naik</span></span><span>dari 3,2</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"kpi__label\">Bounce rate</div><div class=\"kpi__value\">41%</div><div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--down delta--good\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>3 poin<span class=\"sr-only\"> turun</span></span><span>dari 44%</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"kpi\"><div class=\"kpi__label\">Waktu di halaman</div><div class=\"kpi__value\">2 mnt 48 dtk</div><div class=\"kpi__meta\"><span class=\"delta delta--pill delta--down delta--bad\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span>9 dtk<span class=\"sr-only\"> turun</span></span><span>dari 2 mnt 57 dtk</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
      },
